re shut down.\\n\\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01NK4kFG8qyevx9Bk9jWoEgS\\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01PdDdZrB8Q5eMgej5FmRx4R\\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LZ92BDLHrn6xACczVMtSiR\",\"authorName\":\"dkayiwa\",\"authorEmail\":\"dkayiwa@openmrs.org\"},{\"hash\":\"1b5421a9a8d69030adb91124c3f9cb758dbc58a8\",\"date\":\"2026-07-24T11:14:02-04:00\",\"message\":\"TRUNK-6712: Cache flattened role privileges for privilege and superuser checks (#6383)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"Ian\",\"authorEmail\":\"52504170+ibacher@users.noreply.github.com\"},{\"hash\":\"84963803c794accceb19cf2236b859c747371336\",\"date\":\"2026-07-01T13:43:53+02:00\",\"message\":\"Fix @since 2.9.x to 2.9.0\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"rkorytkowski\",\"authorEmail\":\"rafal.korytkowski@gmail.com\"},{\"hash\":\"c4aca3af4154dc99969cb6aed48a1e71c9a70055\",\"date\":\"2026-07-01T11:17:09+02:00\",\"message\":\"Porting TRUNK-6429 and TRUNK-6515 to master (#6233)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"* TRUNK-6429: Create application events for service method calls and entity changes (#6084)\\n\\n(cherry picked from commit 144fee399f79b7152f2fcbaade069a7cfd3285e3)\\n\\n* TRUNK-6516: Provide CDC mechanism with Debezium (#6151)\\n\\n(cherry picked from commit 57f4018ffbcdb27dac86677ca2791d9fae6cfc89)\\n\\n* TRUNK-6429: Addressing post commit review (#6190)\\n\\n(cherry picked from commit a4331e297c2ad33b9d615174f7b6e52b26ef236c)\",\"authorName\":\"Rafal Korytkowski\",\"authorEmail\":\"rafal.korytkowski@gmail.com\"}],\"totalCount\":6}"}],"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01SZCKY5FgoxvYABymfLN86o","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
